WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From tabletop, bring the right knee behind the right wrist.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Extend the left leg back.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Square the hips as much as is comfortable.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Fold forward over the front leg or stay upright.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
